    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/717f8649aaac51556d347b688d2993a3.avif?t=1754132693\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an unpredictable adventure</strong> <strong>with Ash through love, friendship, and supernatural chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Love is a Demon</i> is a narrative adventure game that takes you on a heartfelt and hilarious ride through the complexities of romance and personal growth. Step into the shoes of Ash, an introverted dreamer finally ready to confess their feelings to their best friend, Ivy. But just as everything seems to fall into place, an unforeseen supernatural event throws their world into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Story</strong> \u2013 Explore Ash\u2019s world through immersive, interactive moments that pull you deeper into their journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Narrative</strong> \u2013 Every choice you make influences Ash\u2019s relationships and leads to different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh &amp; Cringe</strong> \u2013 Enjoy witty dialogue, quirky interactions, and absurd situations that make love feel messier than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Journey:</strong> Explore love, friendship, and self-discovery through relatable moments that resonate with your heart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve &amp; Explore:</strong> Solve fun puzzles that reflect the ups and downs of Ash\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your decisions shape Ash\u2019s path and determine the outcomes of their love story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Exploration:</strong> Build relationships, uncover backstories, and explore how each character\u2019s dynamics influence the journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Ash find the courage to confess, or will otherworldly chaos derail their plans?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices. Your love life. Your demonic mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/717f8649aaac51556d347b688d2993a3.avif?t=1754132693\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on an unpredictable adventure</strong> <strong>with Ash through love, friendship, and supernatural chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Love is a Demon</i> is a narrative adventure game that takes you on a heartfelt and hilarious ride through the complexities of romance and personal growth. Step into the shoes of Ash, an introverted dreamer finally ready to confess their feelings to their best friend, Ivy. But just as everything seems to fall into place, an unforeseen supernatural event throws their world into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Story</strong> \u2013 Explore Ash\u2019s world through immersive, interactive moments that pull you deeper into their journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Narrative</strong> \u2013 Every choice you make influences Ash\u2019s relationships and leads to different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh &amp; Cringe</strong> \u2013 Enjoy witty dialogue, quirky interactions, and absurd situations that make love feel messier than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Journey:</strong> Explore love, friendship, and self-discovery through relatable moments that resonate with your heart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve &amp; Explore:</strong> Solve fun puzzles that reflect the ups and downs of Ash\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your decisions shape Ash\u2019s path and determine the outcomes of their love story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Exploration:</strong> Build relationships, uncover backstories, and explore how each character\u2019s dynamics influence the journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Ash find the courage to confess, or will otherworldly chaos derail their plans?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices. Your love life. Your demonic mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
